     "claim": "F_prison",
     "type": "established",
     "claim_text": "RECORDS (via the researcher): New York State Archives records show Abagnale held at Great Meadow prison, Comstock, New York (inmate 25367) from 26 July 1965 to 24 December 1968, i.e. aged 17 to 20 (born 1948), with a brief parole in 1967 before he was returned. Logan: 'confined for the most part in prison during those years'. Narration: 'What did he find? Prison records, age 17 to 20.'",
